# uze snapshot · protocol 1 · view 100x30 · dark
 showcase · showcase@local

  Retry policy

  Make payment retries back off and stop after five attempts.

  • read the current retry loop
  • write failing tests for the backoff
  • implement exponential backoff with jitter

  │ Keep the existing timeout.

  ─ The change ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    fn backoff(attempt: u32) -> Duration {
        let base = Duration::from_millis(100);
        base * 2u32.pow(attempt.min(5))
    }











